.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-edit 1  "edit " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-edit \- Open a draft in $EDITOR
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc edit\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-editor\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open a draft in $EDITOR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-\-editor\fR \fI<EDITOR>\fR
Editor name from [editors] (default: first configured, else $EDITOR)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Draft slug, path, or Message\-ID to open
